Message-ID: <839691710905021118p20ac19d7g5b662a5fab08752b@mail.gmail.com>

Hi Nicholas,

It seems that you need to run AmeliaView at a different permission
level. Currently, AmeliaView cannot access certain files it needs in
order to run. We have not tested the program on Vista, but a quick bit
of looking about leads me to believe you may be able to right-click on
the "AmeliaView" icon and select "Run As Administrator." I think this
should resolve the problems you are having.

If this does not work, you can always load AmeliaView through R.
Simply start R and type the following two lines of code:

library(Amelia)
AmeliaView()

This should fire up the GUI. I hope that helps.

cheers,
matt.

